 115+ 8170              ;===========================================================
 116+ 8170              ; routine called when player collides with a skull
 117+ 8170              ; it
 118+ 8170              ;   reduces health value and shows result
 119+ 8170              ;   on zero health, falls into lost life and shows result
 120+ 8170              ;===========================================================
 121+ 8170              takeDamage:
 122+ 8170 3A C6 8E             ld a, (playerHealth)                        ; get current health value
 123+ 8173 3D                   dec a                                       ; take damage !
 124+ 8174 32 C6 8E             ld (playerHealth), a                        ; set it back
 125+ 8177 5F                   ld e,  a                                    ; preserve in E
