 131+ 8180 3E 88                ld a, 136                                   ; udg graphic to use, 136 is 0 length, 128 is full block strength
 132+ 8182 93                   sub e                                       ; deduct current health block value
 133+ 8183 CD 85 86             call displayChar                            ; display the char
 134+ 8186 7B                   ld a, e                                     ; get health value back
 135+ 8187 A7                   and a                                       ; was it 0?
