  48+ 8686 D5                   push de                                     ; save DE in case of call from Bin8ToDec
  49+ 8687
  50+ 8687 CB 20                sla b                                       ; multiply Y by 8 to get pixel Y
  51+ 8689 CB 20                sla b
  52+ 868B CB 20                sla b
