 757  986F              ; checkKeyCollect
 758  986F              ; Tests whether the player's 2x2 footprint overlaps any
 759  986F              ; AVAILABLE key's 2x2 block.
 760  986F              ; Returns: A = key index (0..KEY_COUNT-1) and carry SET if a
 761  986F              ;          key was collected; carry CLEAR (A undefined) if none.
