 935  9979 E6 07                and 7
 936  997B FD 6F                ld iyl, a
 937  997D                      DIV_HL_8                                    ; divide by 8 to get tile Y
 937  997D             >; simple 16-bit divide without the CALL/RET overhead
 937  997D CB 3C       >        srl h                                       ; divide by 2
 937  997F CB 1D       >        rr l
 937  9981 CB 3C       >        srl h                                       ; divide by 4
 937  9983 CB 1D       >        rr l
