 940  998A              ; Decide only when grid-aligned (iyh==0 AND iyl==0) - the only
 941  998A                      ; moment a turn is possible. "Tile changed" fired at the far tile
 942  998A                      ; edge when moving up/left, where the turn check is gated out.
